#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:2
msgid "2. Atomic Transactions & Dynamic Subtrees"
msgstr "2. 原子事务与动态子树管理"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:4
msgid ""
"All structural changes to a retained ``XtkScene``—creating controls, "
"dropping subtrees, inserting, reordering, reparenting, and binding event "
"listeners—happen inside an ``XtkTxn`` transaction declared in "
"``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>``."
msgstr ""
"保留式 ``XtkScene`` 的所有结构性变更——创建控件、销毁子树、插入、同级重排、跨父节点重挂载以及绑定事件监听——"
"都在 ``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>`` 声明的 ``XtkTxn`` 事务中完成。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:9
msgid "All-or-Nothing Commit Guarantee"
msgstr "全有或全无的原子提交保证"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:11
msgid ""
"When you call ``xtk_txn_commit(&txn, &diag)``, the host executes four "
"stages (``VALIDATE``, ``PREFLIGHT``, ``PREPARE``, ``COMMIT``):"
msgstr "调用 ``xtk_txn_commit(&txn, &diag)`` 时，宿主按四个阶段执行（ ``VALIDATE`` 、 ``PREFLIGHT`` 、 ``PREPARE`` 、 ``COMMIT`` ）："

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:14
msgid ""
"Every handle generation, parent-child cycle rule, registered control "
"type, property type, and memory allocation is verified before the live "
"tree is mutated."
msgstr "在触碰活动树之前，预先校验全部句柄代次、父子无环约束、已注册控件类型、属性类型及所需内存分配。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:17
msgid ""
"When validation and preparation succeed, all operations take effect "
"together and ``xtk_scene_revision(&scene)`` advances."
msgstr "校验与准备全部通过后，批次内的所有变更一次性生效，并推进 ``xtk_scene_revision(&scene)`` 版本号。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:19
msgid ""
"When any operation fails, ``xtk_txn_commit`` returns ``NULL``, fills the "
"optional ``XtkBatchDiag`` struct, and leaves the live ``XtkScene`` "
"untouched."
msgstr "若任意一步失败， ``xtk_txn_commit`` 返回 ``NULL`` 、填入可选的 ``XtkBatchDiag`` 诊断结构，并保持原有 ``XtkScene`` 完好不变。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:23
msgid "Transaction Operations Overview"
msgstr "事务操作函数一览"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:29
msgid "Function"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:30
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:31
msgid "``xtk_txn_begin(&scene, &txn)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_begin(&scene, &txn)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:32
msgid "Opens a fresh transaction backed by a new ``XtkBatch``."
msgstr "开启一个由新 ``XtkBatch`` 承载的事务。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:33
msgid "``xtk_<ctrl>_create(&txn, parent, &props)``"
msgstr "``xtk_<ctrl>_create(&txn, parent, &props)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:34
msgid ""
"Typed control creation from ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``; appends the new "
"control to ``parent`` and returns an ``XtkLocalId``."
msgstr "``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 中的强类型创建函数；将新控件追加到 ``parent`` 末尾并返回 ``XtkLocalId`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:36
msgid "``xtk_txn_create(&txn, type, parent, before, patches, count)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_create(&txn, type, parent, before, patches, count)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:37
msgid ""
"Low-level creation for any ``XtkCtrlId`` (such as ``XTK_CTRL_LISTITEM`` "
"or ``XTK_CTRL_GROUPHEADER``) with explicit ``before`` positioning."
msgstr "面向任意 ``XtkCtrlId`` （如 ``XTK_CTRL_LISTITEM`` 或 ``XTK_CTRL_GROUPHEADER`` ）的底层创建函数，支持指定 ``before`` 插入位置。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:39
msgid "``xtk_txn_insert(&txn, parent, child, before)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_insert(&txn, parent, child, before)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:40
msgid ""
"Inserts an unparented node before ``before`` (or at the end when "
"``before`` is ``xtk_ref_none()``)."
msgstr "将尚无父节点的控件插入到 ``before`` 之前（ ``before`` 为 ``xtk_ref_none()`` 时追加到末尾）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:42
msgid "``xtk_txn_move(&txn, parent, child, before)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_move(&txn, parent, child, before)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:43
msgid "Reorders ``child`` among siblings under its current ``parent``."
msgstr "在当前同一个 ``parent`` 下调整 ``child`` 的同级排列顺序。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:44
msgid "``xtk_txn_reparent(&txn, child, new_parent, before)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_reparent(&txn, child, new_parent, before)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:45
msgid "Moves ``child`` from its existing parent into ``new_parent``."
msgstr "将已有父节点的 ``child`` 迁移至新的父节点 ``new_parent`` 下。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:46
msgid "``xtk_txn_drop(&txn, target)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_drop(&txn, target)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:47
msgid ""
"Destroys ``target`` and its entire descendant subtree, automatically "
"removing its event subscriptions and invalidating old ``XtkCtrl`` "
"generations."
msgstr "销毁 ``target`` 及其全部后代子树，自动解除其上的事件订阅并使旧 ``XtkCtrl`` 代次失效。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:50
msgid "``xtk_txn_commit(&txn, &diag)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_commit(&txn, &diag)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:51
msgid ""
"Atomically commits the batch and returns a heap-allocated "
"``XtkBatchResult *`` (or ``NULL`` on error)."
msgstr "原子提交整个批次并返回堆分配的 ``XtkBatchResult *`` （出错时返回 ``NULL`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:53
msgid "``xtk_txn_abort(&txn)``"
msgstr "``xtk_txn_abort(&txn)``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:54
msgid "Discards an uncommitted transaction and frees its internal batch buffer."
msgstr "放弃尚未提交的事务并释放其内部批次缓冲区。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:57
msgid "Addressing Nodes with ``XtkNodeRef``"
msgstr "使用 ``XtkNodeRef`` 统一寻址节点"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:59
msgid ""
"Inside an open ``XtkTxn``, you frequently mix existing committed controls"
" (like ``xtk_scene_root(&scene)``) with controls that were just created "
"two lines above and only have a batch-local ``XtkLocalId``. "
"``XtkNodeRef`` unifies both:"
msgstr ""
"在未提交的 ``XtkTxn`` 中，往往需要同时引用先前已提交的持久控件（如 ``xtk_scene_root(&scene)`` ）"
"和前两行刚创建、仅有批次局部编号 ``XtkLocalId`` 的新控件。 ``XtkNodeRef`` 统一表示这三类引用："

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:63
msgid ""
"``xtk_ref_existing(ctrl)`` — Wraps a live, generation-checked ``XtkCtrl``"
" from an earlier commit."
msgstr "``xtk_ref_existing(ctrl)`` —— 包装先前批次已提交的带代次校验 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:65
msgid ""
"``xtk_ref_local(local_id)`` — Wraps an ``XtkLocalId`` created earlier in "
"the **current** ``XtkTxn``."
msgstr "``xtk_ref_local(local_id)`` —— 包装 **当前** ``XtkTxn`` 中刚创建的 ``XtkLocalId`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:67
msgid ""
"``xtk_ref_none()`` — Represents \"no node\" (used as ``before`` to append"
" at the end of a child list)."
msgstr "``xtk_ref_none()`` —— 空节点引用（作为 ``before`` 参数时表示追加到子列表末尾）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:71
msgid "Resolving ``XtkLocalId`` to ``XtkCtrl`` After Commit"
msgstr "提交后将 ``XtkLocalId`` 解析为持久 ``XtkCtrl``"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:73
msgid ""
"Static labels, containers, and dividers rarely need to be touched again "
"after creation—you can ignore their ``XtkLocalId`` once their children "
"are attached. For controls whose properties you will update later, "
"extract their persistent ``XtkCtrl`` handle from ``XtkBatchResult``:"
msgstr ""
"静态标题、布局容器与分隔线在挂载完子节点后通常无需再次修改，其 ``XtkLocalId`` 用完即可忽略。"
"对于后续需要动态更新属性的控件，可从 ``XtkBatchResult`` 中提取持久 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄："

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:90
msgid ""
"Always release a non-NULL ``XtkBatchResult *`` with "
"``xtk_batchresult_destroy(result)`` once you finish reading "
"``result->controls`` and ``result->subscriptions``."
msgstr "读取完 ``result->controls`` 与 ``result->subscriptions`` 后，调用 ``xtk_batchresult_destroy(result)`` 释放非空的 ``XtkBatchResult *`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:95
msgid "Diagnosing Rejected Batches with ``XtkBatchDiag``"
msgstr "使用 ``XtkBatchDiag`` 排查批次失败原因"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:97
msgid ""
"During development, pass an ``XtkBatchDiag`` to ``xtk_txn_commit`` so any"
" rejected batch immediately tells you which operation failed and why:"
msgstr "开发阶段向 ``xtk_txn_commit`` 传入 ``XtkBatchDiag`` ，可在批次被拒绝时直接定位失败的操作序号与错误码："

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:110
msgid "Common ``diag.error`` causes:"
msgstr "常见 ``diag.error`` 原因："

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:112
msgid ""
"``XTK_BATCH_ERR_BACKEND`` — A control's ``FluxControlModule`` was omitted"
" from ``flux_controls_use`` at startup."
msgstr "``XTK_BATCH_ERR_BACKEND`` —— 启动时漏掉了该控件对应的 ``flux_controls_use`` 模块注册。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:114
msgid ""
"``XTK_BATCH_ERR_UNKNOWN_CONTROL`` / ``STALE_HANDLE`` — An ``XtkCtrl`` "
"handle belongs to a subtree that was already dropped in a prior batch."
msgstr "``XTK_BATCH_ERR_UNKNOWN_CONTROL`` / ``STALE_HANDLE`` —— 传入的 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄所属子树已在之前的批次中被销毁。"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:118
msgid "Atomic Page Switching Pattern"
msgstr "无闪烁原子切页模式"

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:120
msgid ""
"To switch pages in a multi-view imperative app (such as responding to "
"``NavigationView`` or ``TabView`` selection), drop the old page root and "
"build the new page subtree inside **one** ``XtkTxn``:"
msgstr "在多视图命令式应用中切换页面（如响应 ``NavigationView`` 或 ``TabView`` 选择事件）时，在 **同一个** ``XtkTxn`` 内销毁旧页面根节点并构建新页面子树："

#: ../../source/imperative/transactions.rst:153
msgid ""
"Freeing any heap-allocated ``userdata`` structures associated with the "
"old page *after* the drop transaction commits guarantees no dangling "
"pointers while the old controls were still live."
msgstr "在包含 ``xtk_txn_drop`` 的事务成功提交 **之后** 再释放旧页面事件回调所借用的 ``userdata`` 内存，可确保控件存活期间所有借用指针始终有效。"
